From afbb78892e57f35e0e09f84cb288f5d1490e236d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Aug 2024 18:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/53] swdtb: fixup DTB compatible strings (#94)

1. swdtb: plicsw: change the compatible string
2. swdtb: dma: change the compatible string
3. swdtb: mmc: change the compatible string
4. swdtb: ax25: change the compatible string to ae350
5. swdtb: plmt: change the compatible string

*Change the compatible string:
In interrupt-controller@e6400000 node
    compatible = "riscv,plic1"
==>
    compatible = "andestech,plicsw"

*Change the compatible string:
In dma@f0c00000 node
    compatible = "andestech,atcdmac300g"
==>
    compatible = "andestech,atcdmac300"

*Change the compatible string:
In mmc@f0e00000 node
    compatible = "andestech,atfsdc010g"
==>
    compatible = "andestech,atfsdc010"

*Change the compatible string to "ae350":
Example: in AX25
    "andestech,ax25"
==>
    "andestech,ae350"

*Change the compatible string:
Example: in plmt0@e6000000 node
    "riscv,plmt0"
==>
    "andestech,plmt0"

